        "sample": 0,
        "prompt": "Wide eye-level one-point-perspective view from the entrance of a very large, wide and deep rectangular cyberpunk arcade hall at night, looking straight at the back wall. The hall has six separate sections of arcade machines, two on each of three walls. On the left wall stand two clusters, the nearer one lit amber and the farther one lit hot magenta. On the back wall stand two clusters side by side, the left one lit acid green and the right one lit cyan. On the right wall stand two clusters, the farther one lit red and the nearer one lit violet. Each cluster is a long row of eight tall narrow retro arcade cabinets, eight in every cluster, in one tight row, shoulder to shoulder with no gaps, backs against the wall, facing into the room, with neon edge strips in its cluster's colour. Clear gaps of bare wall separate the clusters. Every cabinet has one large flat upright screen glowing plain white with no picture. On the wall above the middle of each cluster hangs one large round neon ring in that cluster's colour, like a portal: six rings in all. The middle of the hall is a wide open floor of wet black concrete that mirrors the neon. Dark steel walls with pipes, cables and vents, a dark ceiling with beams. Deep shadows, saturated colour, cinematic, sharp fine detail. No people, no text, no letters, no logos."
